OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped python rescued from tree
OL,4,Aby member of public
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn escaped python has been plucked
OL,7,F"successfully" from a tree by a member
OL,8,Fof the public, say firefighters.
OL,10,FThe snake, thought to be a carpet
OL,11,Fpython which is non-venomous, was
OL,12,Fretrieved at about 10:00 BST from a
OL,13,Ftree at Plymouth Hoe near the seafront,
OL,14,Faccording to Devon and Somerset Fire
OL,15,Fand Rescue Service, which was alerted
OL,16,Fon Wednesday.
OL,18,F"The person had used a ladder to climb
OL,19,Fa tree the snake was located in and
OL,20,Ftook it down. The snake has been sent
OL,21,Fto the local vets," a spokesperson for
OL,22,Fthe fire service said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
